### Storage server type

The `type` argument is the storage server type code. Common values:

| `type` | Storage server | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `nfs` | NFS file share | |
| `3par` | HPE 3PAR / Primera | block |
| `isilon` | Dell EMC Isilon | |
| `ecs` | Dell EMC ECS (S3) | |
| `hpealletramp-storage-provider` | HPE Alletra MP and Alletra 9000 (9060/9080) | block; managed by the Alletra MP plugin |
| `hpealletramp-X10000-provider.storage` | HPE Alletra Storage MP X10000 | discovery/sync only — not creatable via this resource |

-> The available types depend on the storage plugins installed. Query the full
set for your environment with `GET /api/storage-server-types`.

